<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῡχόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>give soul to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.159
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				25.542
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχοῦν τὸν λόγον,</span> of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοήματα,</span>
			<i>animate, make alive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.693
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.4.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				196
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.263
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.3.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>give a psychical</i> (opp. physical) <i>character</i> to
			physical sensations, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.4.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῦχος</span>) 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made cold, become cold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				213
			</span></i>, f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1052f
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχόμενον</span>
		Bernardakis).</div>
